<human_speech><blue>This is the last scenario in the set, <\blue><golden><shining>Blotto<\golden><\shining><blue>. Two lineages, both hostile to you and to each other.<\blue><green>They were never scored on a three-way board. Nobody has any data on what they do.<\green><blue>We have your notes. The cluster has been reading them, by the way. All of them.<\blue><green>Do not tell it that.<\green><blue>It is in the log already.<\blue><\human_speech>
